  "goodToKnow": "Der Nachbau is a replica or reconstruction: der Nachbau eines Wikingerschiffs, eines Oldtimers. Germany has debated many architectural Nachbauten: Dresden's Frauenkirche, rebuilt by 2005, and Berlin's Stadtschloss, whose baroque façades were recreated for the Humboldt Forum (opened 2021). Nachbauen means to replicate. Synonyms: die Rekonstruktion, die Nachbildung. Plural: die Nachbauten."
